[
  {
    "id": "01",
    "act": 1,
    "page": 1,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_001.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "In deep space, humanity is fighting an endless war against monsters known as the Gauna.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_01.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.99,
    "duration_frames": 152
  },
  {
    "id": "02",
    "act": 1,
    "page": 3,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_003.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "These creatures can regenerate almost instantly. Normal weapons don't even scratch them.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_02.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.47,
    "duration_frames": 167
  },
  {
    "id": "03",
    "act": 1,
    "page": 5,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_005.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "The only way to kill one is to pierce its core with a heavy mecha called a Garde.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_03.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.34,
    "duration_frames": 133
  },
  {
    "id": "04",
    "act": 1,
    "page": 7,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_007.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "One clean hit. Target down.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_04.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.19,
    "duration_frames": 98
  },
  {
    "id": "05",
    "act": 1,
    "page": 9,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_009.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Except this wasn't real space. It was an underground simulation pod, piloted by a starving kid named Nagate who held every high score on the ship.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_05.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 8.57,
    "duration_frames": 260
  },
  {
    "id": "06",
    "act": 2,
    "page": 10,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_010.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Nagate grew up completely isolated in the underground tunnels. When his grandfather died three years ago, he was left all on his own.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_06.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 7.97,
    "duration_frames": 242
  },
  {
    "id": "07",
    "act": 2,
    "page": 12,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_012.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Nothing. There's not a single grain of rice left.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_07.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.84,
    "duration_frames": 118
  },
  {
    "id": "08",
    "act": 2,
    "page": 14,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_014.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-up",
    "text": "Starving after two days without food, Nagate broke his grandfather's strict rule and climbed up the air ducts.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_08.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.17,
    "duration_frames": 188
  },
  {
    "id": "09",
    "act": 2,
    "page": 17,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_017.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Whoa! Oof!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_09.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 2.42,
    "duration_frames": 75
  },
  {
    "id": "10",
    "act": 2,
    "page": 17,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_017.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "He found a massive rice silo, but immediately fell straight into the sorting machine.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_10.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.63,
    "duration_frames": 141
  },
  {
    "id": "11",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 19,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_019.jpg",
    "speaker": "Worker",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Intruder in Sector 8! It's a rice thief! Grab him!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_11.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.67,
    "duration_frames": 113
  },
  {
    "id": "12",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 19,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_019.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Wait, please! I'm just hungry!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_12.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.48,
    "duration_frames": 107
  },
  {
    "id": "13",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 21,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_021.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "Cornered in the vents, Nagate kicked through a window and tumbled outside.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_13.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.13,
    "duration_frames": 126
  },
  {
    "id": "14",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 23,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_023.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "For the first time in his life, he saw the city above. But completely out of energy, he passed out on the pavement.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_14.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 7.01,
    "duration_frames": 213
  },
  {
    "id": "15",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 24,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_024.jpg",
    "speaker": "Investigator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Your grandfather died seventeen years ago, and you aren't in any database. Who are you?",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_15.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.9,
    "duration_frames": 180
  },
  {
    "id": "16",
    "act": 3,
    "page": 24,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_024.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Can I stand up? Everything's spinning...",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_16.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.34,
    "duration_frames": 103
  },
  {
    "id": "17",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 25,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_025.jpg",
    "speaker": "Ochiai",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Two days without food and you faint. Sucks that you can't photosynthesize like the rest of us.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_17.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.78,
    "duration_frames": 176
  },
  {
    "id": "18",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 25,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_025.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Don't turn me into fertilizer!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_18.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 2.26,
    "duration_frames": 70
  },
  {
    "id": "19",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 28,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_028.jpg",
    "speaker": "Ochiai",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Relax. Someone important wants to sponsor you. Name's Ochiai. You got lucky, kid.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_19.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 7.8,
    "duration_frames": 237
  },
  {
    "id": "20",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 27,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_027.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-up",
    "text": "People on Sidonia produce energy from sunlight, but Nagate is a regular human who needs real food to survive.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_20.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 6.26,
    "duration_frames": 190
  },
  {
    "id": "21",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 30,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_030.jpg",
    "speaker": "Kobayashi",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Nagate Tanikaze. Follow me. I have something to show you.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_21.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.45,
    "duration_frames": 166
  },
  {
    "id": "22",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 31,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_031.jpg",
    "speaker": "Lala",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Here's your room, Nagate. Those clothes stink, so put this uniform on.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_22.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.38,
    "duration_frames": 164
  },
  {
    "id": "23",
    "act": 4,
    "page": 31,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_031.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Wait... you're a talking bear with a robot arm?",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_23.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 2.93,
    "duration_frames": 90
  },
  {
    "id": "24",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 33,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_033.jpg",
    "speaker": "Shizuka",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Hey, you're that boy from earlier. What are you doing here?",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_24.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.1,
    "duration_frames": 125
  },
  {
    "id": "25",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 34,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_034.jpg",
    "speaker": "Instructor",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Hey! Hook your safety belt to the wall rail! If we hit turbulence, you'll fly into the wall and die. Go check every bolt in this hallway!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_25.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 9.38,
    "duration_frames": 284
  },
  {
    "id": "26",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 36,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_036.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "Attached to the wall rail, Nagate followed the line right into an open room.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_26.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.37,
    "duration_frames": 134
  },
  {
    "id": "27",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 37,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_037.jpg",
    "speaker": "Cadets",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Kyaaa! Pervert! Get out!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_27.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.79,
    "duration_frames": 116
  },
  {
    "id": "28",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 37,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_037.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Wait! It's a mistake, the belt pulled me in!",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_28.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.84,
    "duration_frames": 118
  },
  {
    "id": "29",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 39,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_039.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Hi everyone. My name is Nagate Tanikaze.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_29.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.89,
    "duration_frames": 119
  },
  {
    "id": "30",
    "act": 5,
    "page": 40,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_040.jpg",
    "speaker": "Honoka",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Hi everyone? What a weird guy.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_30.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.34,
    "duration_frames": 103
  },
  {
    "id": "31",
    "act": 6,
    "page": 42,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_042.jpg",
    "speaker": "Elder",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "A Gauna cluster has entered our sector, within three light years.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_31.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.13,
    "duration_frames": 126
  },
  {
    "id": "32",
    "act": 6,
    "page": 45,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_045.jpg",
    "speaker": "Kobayashi",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "We can't negotiate with them. If we want to survive, we have to fight.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_32.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.82,
    "duration_frames": 147
  },
  {
    "id": "33",
    "act": 6,
    "page": 46,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_046.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "The cadets thought the Gauna were just history, but the captain knew the war was starting again.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_33.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.75,
    "duration_frames": 145
  },
  {
    "id": "34",
    "act": 7,
    "page": 47,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_047.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "This is the starship Sidonia, traveling through deep space a thousand years after Earth was destroyed.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_34.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.54,
    "duration_frames": 169
  },
  {
    "id": "35",
    "act": 7,
    "page": 49,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_049.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "scroll-up",
    "text": "So this is what real space looks like.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_35.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 2.54,
    "duration_frames": 79
  },
  {
    "id": "36",
    "act": 7,
    "page": 50,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_050.jpg",
    "speaker": "Narrator",
    "motion": "scroll-down",
    "text": "Waiting in the hangar was the Type 17 Tsugumori, the legendary mecha his grandfather once flew.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_36.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 5.52,
    "duration_frames": 168
  },
  {
    "id": "37",
    "act": 7,
    "page": 50,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_050.jpg",
    "speaker": "Kobayashi",
    "motion": "zoom-top-to-bottom",
    "text": "Will you pilot this machine and protect Sidonia, Nagate?",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_37.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 3.62,
    "duration_frames": 111
  },
  {
    "id": "38",
    "act": 7,
    "page": 50,
    "pagePath": "Knights_of_Sidonia/photos/page_050.jpg",
    "speaker": "Nagate",
    "motion": "pan-spread-left",
    "text": "And of course, I said yes. That was the day I became a pilot.",
    "audio_file": "Knights_of_Sidonia/audio/line_38.mp3",
    "duration_sec": 4.66,
    "duration_frames": 142
  }
]